{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13771","headline":"黄鹄楼歌送独孤助 · 顾况","name":"黄鹄楼歌送独孤助","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人西去黄鹄楼，西江之水上天流，黄鹄杳杳江悠悠。\n黄鹄徘徊故人别，离壶酒尽清丝绝。\n绿屿没余烟，白沙连晓月。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13771.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13771","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}